    "details": "VulnCheck reports:\n\n> rsync through 3.5.1 contains a denial of service vulnerability in the\n> delta-transfer sender\\'s hash_search() in match.c that allows\n> malicious receivers to trigger unbounded strong-checksum work at\n> consecutive offsets. Unauthenticated attackers pulling from a public\n> daemon module can supply weak checksums colliding with consecutive\n> rolling windows plus non-matching strong checksums, exhausting sender\n> CPU across concurrent connections.\n",
    "id": "FreeBSD-2026-0595",
